---
description: Assess one actually retained checkpoint at the supported measurement boundary through the installed performance hierarchy.
args:
  profile: RetainedProfile
returns: IncidentAssessment
---
Assess this exact retained checkpoint through the performance hierarchy when its request describes a supported native measurement. Preserve the profile's checkpoint identity, trace and diagnostic with the actual performance review. A completed source build is not a measurement of runtime memory, and a failed build cannot establish successful completion or a verified warm cache. Do not substitute a similarly named unit, another revision or invented measurements. Return the actual checkpoint and review as an IncidentAssessment for the caller's comparison or diagnosis.
